+ * enum qbth_misc_bit - bits in btqcom_data.misc_flags
+ * @QBTH_MISC_MEMDUMP_READY: memdump registration succeeded
+ * @QBTH_MISC_MEMDUMP_ACTIVE: a memdump happens
+ * @QBTH_MISC_RESET_ACTIVE: a reset is in progress
