Cc: <stable@vger.kernel.org> # 6.10
Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
Changes from RFC
- RFC: https://lore.kernel.org/20260711171537.75278-1-sj@kernel.org
- Drop RFC tag.

